# Build context pruning — the build stage runs a fresh `pnpm install`, so never ship local
# installs/output or secrets into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/.turbo
**/.cache
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
